-    Define $N=5$ one-dimensional transfer functions $T_i: \mathbb{R} \rightarrow \mathbb{R}^4$ for $i = 1, \dots, 5$. Each $T_i$ maps a single scalar property $x_i$ to a 4D vector containing color $(R, G, B)$ and opacity $\alpha$ [S1].
