 8.  **Combine into MDTF:**
     Combine the 1D functions into the 5D transfer function $T: \mathbb{R}^5 \rightarrow \mathbb{R}^4$. The final opacity $\alpha$ is the average of the individual opacities [S1]:
     $$ \alpha = T_\alpha(\mathbf{x}) = \frac{1}{N} \sum_{i=1}^{N} T_{i,\alpha}(x_i) $$
