+    The final color $(R, G, B)$ is the average of the individual colors weighted by their respective opacities [S1]:
+    $$ \mathbf{C} = T_{RGB}(\mathbf{x}) = \frac{1}{N} \sum_{i=1}^{N} T_{i,RGB}(x_i) \cdot T_{i,\alpha}(x_i) $$
 
